GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_Tanya_Staging> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_Tanya_Staging> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Actor_Tanya_Staging> ;
    narr:childCount "75"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "84af2dc9771b17246fd7b8a5a506d8ba6e2670b1" ;
    narr:narration """This actor hub holds two registers. The long spine is [a single assertion repeated near-daily](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EDefaultRef1788169170042_1) from the first dated entry through [the latest repetition](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_2_E2EDefaultRef1790588738388_h582f6c72cf26_1), with [an alternate dated log](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2E2EDefaultRef1788341794428_1) in the same cadence — claim-level conviction in a concrete, present-tense, realis frame throughout. From late in the span a second register appears: [a ruling issued in an owner capacity](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_1), its substance — [one bundle per run per person](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_2) — argued in plain-spoken antithesis, [a boundary held against pushback](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_3), and [a rejected alternative recorded with its reason](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_5), re-voiced across [a second rendering](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_3DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_1), [a third](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_hf8fb95c0b315_1), [a fourth](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260924_2_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESyntheticAttempt2_haec961429483_1), [a fifth](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260926_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_ha66ee8b3c008_1), and [a sixth](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h801a6165fef3_1). The weekly-roll-up ruling extends the register: [a roll-up added on Fridays](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_2), with [the run-versus-week scope clarified](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_4), [a question about replacement answered](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_3), [a daily digest rejected as redundant](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260925_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h5c24fdddd3e5_5), and [the same ruling re-voiced](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260927_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_hf65a0248bea8_2). A further rendering of the weekly ruling arrives at the close of the span: [the roll-up rule restated](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_2), with [the replacement question answered again](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_4) and [the daily digest rejected once more](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260929_1_WeeklyRollUpRulingE2EAgenticSynthetic_h94add5a10097_5). A seventh rendering of the delivery-routing ruling lands on the final dated day: [the owner frame re-set](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_2), [the bundle rule restated](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_3), [the batching-window pushback carried as reported speech](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_4), [the boundary held again](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_5), and [the rejected alternative recorded once more](narr:https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260930_1_DeliveryRoutingRulingE2ESynthetic_h8da21f01f22b_6). A query for anything beyond the repeated assertion and these delivery-routing rulings is honestly not-here.""" ;
